        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nSimplify the expression [MATH: \\left|-\\dfrac{9}{5c}\\right|.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nFirstly, since [MATH: |-a| = |a|,] we can write our expression as\n\n[MATH: \\left|\\dfrac{9}{5c}\\right|.]\n\nThen, we distribute the absolute value over the division, and simplify:\n\n[MATH: |(9)/(5c)||=; (|9|)/(|5c|)|=; (9)/(|5c|)|=; (9)/(|5|\u22c5|c|)|=; (9)/(5|c|)]"
