        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nSimplify the expression [MATH: |\u2212 (5x)/(3y)|.]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: \u2212 (5|x|)/(3|y|)]\nb. [MATH: \u2212 15xy]\nc. [MATH: 15xy]\nd. [MATH: (5|x|)/(3|y|)]\ne. [MATH: (5)/(3)]"
